<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>The Pudding — the middle ages</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { background: #1b0719; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #1b0719;
    color: #ead7e8;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  a { color: #d34dbd; }
